{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1070802,\"title\":\"Confidential Informant\",\"tagline\":\"The action-thriller movie is based on true events\",\"overview\":\"During a crack epidemic two narcotics agents hunting for a cop killer. Hoping for leads, Moran and Thorton pay off a junkie informant. To provide for his wife and son, Moran involves the stool pigeon in a deadly scheme. This causes the partners to come under the scrutiny of a suspicious internal affairs agent.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3MqxGqMdq4eqzWN6H7ugEdYv1W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bUq0Zts4VSYLMVoJ7TSrAduL58N.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":144,\"year\":2023,\"runtime\":88,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Michael Oblowitz\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":82829,\"name\":\"Michael Oblowitz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bVrj724WsL2EcIa43HqA8kqY3ob.jpg\"},{\"id\":10862,\"name\":\"Dominic Purcell\",\"character\":\"Tom Moran\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5GtHSYdnH7o2x5UIm09XqqLoJKO.jpg\"},{\"id\":7517,\"name\":\"Kate Bosworth\",\"character\":\"Anna Moran\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ezaM2jsyrxXWVFN1SbH3UfAgZaG.jpg\"},{\"id\":2461,\"name\":\"Mel Gibson\",\"character\":\"Kevin Hickey\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jnqHMaOslt8cef2atSmOpGRvNla.jpg\"},{\"id\":6408,\"name\":\"Nick Stahl\",\"character\":\"Mike Thorton\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hV1Fs7LcYWBQ90hWYA3DrCh0rPV.jpg\"},{\"id\":2634594,\"name\":\"Arielle Raycene\",\"character\":\"Ginger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nhCNfUJzAP74KHWc1ZCDnbks8w8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1367619,\"name\":\"Erik Valdez\",\"character\":\"Carlos, Señor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gx6VVWA5l7oMhJ5pQ2f9VAWjl8Y.