\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5C6njaciKvyZlKWUrQX7mjdl4D1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the harrowing death of his partner, forensic psychologist and best-selling author Alex Cross cannot forgive himself and has retreated to the peace of retirement. But when a brilliant criminal kidnaps a senator's young daughter, he is lured back into action as the kidnapper wants to deal with Alex personally. Teamed with Jezzie Flanigan, the Secret Service agent assigned to protect the missing girl, Alex follows a serpentine trail of clues that leads him to a stunning discovery - the kidnapper wants more than just ransom.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440471,\"title\":\"Escape Plan 2: Hades\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A6tb8JNrie2qT8JC2tGqshayuck.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xIAaN3AQqaJiN5RJ0WsmBady8Hq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world's most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":24253,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Played with Fire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A8UjhPjINIBgmoH37aqt40u53PQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nra78PoXu2lQhdgFKJ8y8zL7HGN.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mikael Blomkvist, publisher of Millennium magazine, has made his living exposing the crooked and corrupt practices of establishment Swedish figures. So when a young journalist approaches him with a meticulously researched thesis about sex trafficking in Sweden and those in high office who abuse underage girls, Blomkvist immediately throws himself into the investigation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":334074,\"title\":\"Survivor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/npyCpfYyYknFoY2iJPyfqp70FVX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kbvSneIEkEcxHZ3AayZUEN2xC1P.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Foreign Service Officer in London tries to prevent a terrorist attack set to hit New York, but is forced to go on the run when she is framed for crimes she did not commit.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11371,\"title\":\"The Score\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCBcuOw60wjzLvg9oJdZKlBn1nG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":34813,\"title\":\"The Losers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e5oD3fuQpjZ8Po6WNW0VkUJmW52.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hACMcim5NtMH3S62sQAWkdLVpIK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a mission deep in the Bolivian jungle, a team of elite commandos finds itself on the receiving end of a lethal betrayal. Now presumed dead, the men join forces with a mysterious operative named Aisha to hunt down their enemy and even the score.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":269494,\"title\":\"A Hard Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIkc5DwGPZIdImSudkUDQ799rq3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u0os34ctKo55sx6krTbO381ohNR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After trying to cover up a car accident that left a man dead, a crooked homicide detective is stalked by a mysterious man claiming to have witnessed the event.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":974453,\"title\":\"Absolution\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/urQRTWxekNi6OS7RP5vWblEssQj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7bIWKyWdT04HTY3PqLETT8CH7jo.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aging ex-boxer gangster working as muscle for a Boston crime boss receives an upsetting diagnosis.  Despite a faltering memory, he attempts to rectify the sins of his past and reconnect with his estranged children. He is determined to leave a positive legacy for his grandson, but the criminal underworld isn’t done with him and won’t loosen their grip willingly.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4959,\"title\":\"The International\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fneofXacvudxNUKyM61UtoilHRI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rX7EDn70R2L0ijCPRbz5cjoQ73h.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An interpol agent and an attorney are determined to bring one of the world's most powerful banks to justice. Uncovering money laundering, arms trading, and conspiracy to destabilize world governments, their investigation takes them from Berlin, Milan, New York and Istanbul. Finding themselves in a chase across the globe, their relentless tenacity puts their own lives at risk.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22787,\"title\":\"Whiteout\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kkXXA3353MX60B8PRSkTGRabxXu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/18uabdgGRxX4bJr3i6Zon7EXGlA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The only U.S. Marshal assigned to Antarctica, Carrie Stetko will soon leave the harsh environment behind for good – in three days, the sun will set and the Amundsen-Scott Research Station will shut down for the long winter. When a body is discovered out on the open ice, Carrie's investigation into the continent's first homicide plunges her deep into a mystery that may cost her her own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108206,\"title\":\"A Path Where No Man Goes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jg43dmApO5wapwEArtB7gUIzsYw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A character-driven philosophical thriller about an unusual interview between a journalist and a young successful entrepreneur, which later reveals some deep secrets about their lives, and ultimately their connection.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"5MeHC7moE2M\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}